ent-WizardEscapeShuttleObjective = Escape to CentComm on the evacuation shuttle, uncuffed.
    .desc = The Federation has someone on the inside at CentComm. Show up on the evacuation shuttle and don't get cuffed.
ent-WizardRobesObjective = Last until the end of the shift in a wizard's hat and robe.
    .desc = A true wizard doesn't hide who they are. At the end of the shift you must be alive and wearing a magic hat and robe.
